# Cloud Build uploads the whole directory as build context unless told
# otherwise - this folder has service_account.json, .env, and real client
# PII (debug/, chrome_profile/, downloaded_pdfs/, bot_runtime/) that must
# never leave this machine. Ignore everything, then explicitly allow only
# the handful of files this specific build actually needs.
*
!requirements-intake.txt
!Dockerfile.intake
!extract_client_intake.py
!intake_service.py
